#25309
The Chamber of Titivilus~
You are in the private chamber of Titivilus, the messenger of Dispater.
The room is mute testimony to the cruel nature of Titivilus, as the walls
are decorated with tapestries featuring dismemberment and torture, often
with Titivilus himself performing the deed.  The southern wall has a pair
of iron rings set near each other, with blood stains behind them.
~
