#25342
Furcas' Quarters~
The private quarters of General Furcas are truly disgusting.  Slime from his
slug-like hind quarters covers everything, giving off a nauseating odour of
decay.  Bits of flesh showing teeth and claw marks are scattered on the floor,
rotting into dust.  Shredded tapestries hang limply on the walls, showing
scenes of violence and destruction.  A dirty pile of straw in one corner would
appear to be where Furcas sleeps.    
~
